WEBVTT

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:30.741
[YELLS]

00:01:49.778 --> 00:01:50.821
[HISSES]

00:01:56.577 --> 00:01:59.204
Not my daughter, you bitch.

00:01:59.246 --> 00:02:00.706
[LAUGHS]

00:02:23.562 --> 00:02:25.147
[VOLDEMORT YELLS]

00:02:32.571 --> 00:02:33.906
HARRY:
You were right...

00:02:35.657 --> 00:02:38.118
...when you told Snape
that wand was failing you.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.828
It will always fail you.

00:02:41.121 --> 00:02:42.831
VOLDEMORT:
I killed Snape.

00:02:42.873 --> 00:02:45.125
But what if the wand
never belonged to Snape?

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:48.170
What if its allegiance was always
to someone else?

00:02:48.212 --> 00:02:51.423
Come on, Tom.
Let's finish this the way we started it.

00:02:51.882 --> 00:02:52.925
Together.

00:02:55.636 --> 00:02:57.804
[BOTH YELLING]

00:04:21.054 --> 00:04:23.140
[YELLS]

00:05:59.319 --> 00:06:00.821
[STUDENTS CHATTERING]

00:06:27.389 --> 00:06:29.516
-Ha, ha.
-I always figured he would be a big fellow.

00:06:29.558 --> 00:06:34.020
I couldn't find my wand.
I haven't lost my wand in my entire life.

00:06:34.062 --> 00:06:36.189
It was lost in the folds of my gowns.

00:06:36.231 --> 00:06:39.151
I managed to find it
and I dispatched a few of them....

00:06:39.192 --> 00:06:40.569
HAGRID:
Harry.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.195
[HAGRID CHUCKLES]

